# Cameo targets Linux. Everything textual stays LF in the repo *and* in the
# working tree, even when checked out on Windows: a CRLF shebang makes bash
# fail with "\r: command not found", which would break the ISO build and the
# firstboot scripts in ways that are annoying to diagnose from CI logs.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.iso binary
